{"id":"n58278-1-9","stage":1,"title":"제일 · 第一","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n58278-1-9-1","ko":"감기에 걸렸나 봐. 몸이 으슬으슬하네.","zh":"看来是感冒了。浑身发冷呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"감기에","meaning":"感冒","explanation":"감기：感冒；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"감기","audio":"/audio/2c4cdf56b777f3677c17.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28635","senseId":"1","lemma":"감기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"걸렸나","meaning":"患","explanation":"걸리다：患；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"걸리다","audio":"/audio/d94590a358564fb83462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86940","senseId":"8","lemma":"걸리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"몸이","meaning":"身体，身子","explanation":"몸：身体，身子；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"몸","audio":"/audio/955149b012635be1833c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74138","senseId":"1","lemma":"몸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"으슬으슬하네.","meaning":"浑身发冷","explanation":"으슬으슬하다：浑身发冷；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"으슬으슬하다","audio":"/audio/080078a3df3e58c25319.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"course:으슬으슬하다:1","senseId":"1","lemma":"으슬으슬하다","origin":"course-authored supplement"}]}],"words":[{"id":"2c4cdf56b777f367","term":"감기","zh":"感冒","audio":"/audio/2c4cdf56b777f3677c17.mp3","entryId":"28635","definition":"一般伴有咳嗽、流鼻涕、头痛、发冷等症状的传染病。","pronunciation":["감ː기"]},{"id":"d94590a358564fb8","term":"걸리다","zh":"患","audio":"/audio/d94590a358564fb83462.mp3","entryId":"86940","definition":"得病。","pronunciation":["걸리다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"955149b012635be1","term":"몸","zh":"身体，身子","audio":"/audio/955149b012635be1833c.mp3","entryId":"74138","definition":"指从头到脚组成人或动物形象的整体；或指其状态。","pronunciation":["몸"]},{"id":"080078a3df3e58c2","term":"으슬으슬하다","zh":"浑身发冷","audio":"/audio/080078a3df3e58c25319.mp3","definition":"身体一阵阵发冷，常形容感冒、受寒等时的感觉。","pronunciation":[]}],"audio":"/audio/41ecde455a5b93c0a3a6.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n58278-1-9-2","ko":"감기엔 푹 쉬는 게 제일이지.","zh":"感冒的话，好好休息才是最好的办法。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"감기엔","meaning":"感冒","explanation":"감기：感冒；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"감기","audio":"/audio/2c4cdf56b777f3677c17.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28635","senseId":"1","lemma":"감기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"푹","meaning":"睡得很沉或使疲劳的身体得以充分休息的样子。","explanation":"푹：睡得很沉或使疲劳的身体得以充分休息的样子。","readings":[{"term":"푹","audio":"/audio/0080f27d41b51df36d72.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83605","senseId":"1","lemma":"푹","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쉬는","meaning":"休息，歇","explanation":"쉬다：休息，歇；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"쉬다","audio":"/audio/62b3b824836a1f2cb1c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71280","senseId":"1","lemma":"쉬다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"게","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"제일이지.","meaning":"第一","explanation":"제일：第一；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"제일","audio":"/audio/c181b2319e3ac556998a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58278","senseId":"1","lemma":"제일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"2c4cdf56b777f367","term":"감기","zh":"感冒","audio":"/audio/2c4cdf56b777f3677c17.mp3","entryId":"28635","definition":"一般伴有咳嗽、流鼻涕、头痛、发冷等症状的传染病。","pronunciation":["감ː기"]},{"id":"0080f27d41b51df3","term":"푹","zh":"睡得很沉或使疲劳的身体得以充分休息的样子。","audio":"/audio/0080f27d41b51df36d72.mp3","entryId":"83605","definition":"睡得很沉或使疲劳的身体得以充分休息的样子。","pronunciation":["푹"]},{"id":"62b3b824836a1f2c","term":"쉬다","zh":"休息，歇","audio":"/audio/62b3b824836a1f2cb1c5.mp3","entryId":"71280","definition":"为去除疲劳而使身体舒适。","pronunciation":["쉬ː다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"c181b2319e3ac556","term":"제일","zh":"第一","audio":"/audio/c181b2319e3ac556998a.mp3","entryId":"58278","definition":"在多个中排在最前的。","pronunciation":["제ː일"]}],"audio":"/audio/3c607f7859b55b06a6eb.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.593,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=58278","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":39,"sequenceScore":1.7512,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["看来是感冒了。浑身发冷呢。","感冒的话，好好休息才是最好的办法。","大家真守秩序啊。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["看来是感冒了。浑身发冷呢。","感冒的话，好好休息才是最好的办法。","大家真守秩序啊。"],"answer":1}]}
